### Handed on to Dance, grades 9 to 12 (Level 1)

The grade 9 to 12 frame is being written beside this one; the hand-ons below come from the progression's Level 1
rows (`grade` 9 in data/progressions/arts.csv, a data key, never a student's grade). Level 1 is entered by level,
not grade, and assumes no earlier arts learning: its bridge unit teaches the grade 8 techniques and words it needs
as readiness and claims no grade 8 id (STANDARD.md 3.2), so a student who took this course meets them as review.

