389: 
390: 1. **After-core check weeks.** This frame's checks (mid-year week 17, school days 83 and 85, and year-end week 32,
391:    in each of grades 6, 7 and 8) stay off every core check week and day, and follow from the unit days by load.
392:    Left for the lead's one calendar pass over all after-core frames: week 17 also holds health's and physical
393:    education's mid-year checks in all three grades (their day 84, between this frame's days 83 and 85).
394: 2. **Physical education frame's pending line.** docs/courses/physical-education-grades-6-to-8/frame.md, Cross-subject,
395:    "After-core courses": its pending note on dance's units and weeks can now be replaced with "Dance 6 to 8 teaches its rows first in each year: units 1 and 2 (grade
396:    6 weeks 1 to 16), units 5 and 6 (grade 7 weeks 1 to 16), unit 9 (grade 8 weeks 1 to 9); its picks differ from
