docs/reviews/frame-dance-grades-k-to-2-codex-2026-11-25.md:9:**Revise before writing the scope and sequence.** The band structure, ownership, unit order and annual totals are sound, but several owned standards lose required actions, and the participation alternatives can award performance marks without evidence of the child’s performance. Restore those actions and their evidence first, while preserving the existing units and allocations.
