docs/reviews/frame-dance-grades-k-to-2-codex-2026-11-25.md:127:**Exact fix:** Keep hoop dance for watch-and-talk cultural study. Use an age-suitable, nonceremonial excerpt of the already included Kpanlogo for the question-and-movement task, after the promised source and sensitivity check. Ask children what they notice, what an observed choice might suggest and what they still wonder; then have them create an original movement idea and explain its connection to one response.
